crashes when gimp starts up.

kills an application when any dialog window is closed by the window's 
close control.

most dialog windows open with 0 size. All I get is a very small window 
frame.

windows open in all kinds of crazy sizes. gnome-terminal windows can 
open very big, very small, tall and skinny, short and wide, or the right 
size.

